{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-3","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：立方与整数","englishTitle":"If a cube number by multiplying itself make some number, the product will be cube.","book":9,"number":3,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.3","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.3/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":3,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","contentId":"euclid-9-3","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f00b126a004ff0310af15fe96fd4e39b05a062f1aa38d38eabdb13fcacd3d86","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-3.statement","euclid-9-3.construction.1","euclid-9-3.construction.2","euclid-9-3.proof.1","euclid-9-3.proof.2","euclid-9-3.proof.3","euclid-9-3.proof.4","euclid-9-3.proof.5","euclid-9-3.proof.6","euclid-9-3.proof.7","euclid-9-3.proof.8","euclid-9-3.proof.9","euclid-9-3.proof.10","euclid-9-3.proof.11","euclid-9-3.conclusion","euclid-9-3.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-3.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4771834c5d7ecd3c182b179eaf49854a7128730ddb1f66122ef3fc9dc2b1634","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a cube number by multiplying itself make some number, the product will be cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果乘以立方数 本身就得出了数字, 产品将是立方体 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ce61b67f7f7bec8943534bad27c72646d1734049cdb22beb2f7063f84c13d72","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the cube number A by multiplying itself make B; I say that B is cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"乘以立方数 A 本身就等于B; 我说B是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c9549369bc895ca2324f49596f0976d5674039bc2661eca48f2661a0400ff1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let C, the side of A, be taken, and let C by multiplying itself make D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C,A的一边被拿下来,C自己乘D"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8012384b8ca42d081863eecd325af09d89860df22b1c3a13813375ac5474441c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then manifest that C by multiplying D has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"很明显,C乘以D, 已经造就了A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"305f77e35e14645894e6c1b2060c32988f89e0492c9fe158b4a893ac5f5f9c3b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since C by multiplying itself has made D, therefore C measures D according to the units in itself."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,C乘以本身就已经达到D, 因此,根据单位本身的计算,C 整除 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d5eda8544ad92f31559523348ea56441fdb04462a9045742ca4c9a4b67045b4d","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But further the unit also measures C according to the units in it; therefore, as the unit is to C, so is C to D. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据其中的单位,单位和整除,C,单位和C的比例相等;因此,单位和C的比例等于C和D的比例。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"33a40519b2eadffd6be9ad67afc2b916cb6822be19109b167561b624d0f6048f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since C by multiplying D has made A, therefore D measures A according to the units in C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C乘以D, 使A, 因此,根据C的单位, C的D, 整除, A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"55c1930abd797919b81f4be89d4cd95f1eb433a4c88aa95a9caaf2713271425a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit also measures C according to the units in it; therefore, as the unit is to C, so is D to A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位的数据,单位的整除 C也与单位的单位和C的单位的比相同;因此,单位和C的比等于D和A的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b547932c05af03f72c722918b18d3134a15f2bee1c57162c4fc22782689c8673","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the unit is to C, so is C to D; therefore also, as the unit is to C, so is C to D, and D to A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,单位-C的比等于C-D的比;因此,单位-C的比等于C-D和D-A的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"076cbd6855ac59c750378c48a89cf60c759e068637d66a51c12426ce73a58a04","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore between the unit and the number A two mean proportional numbers C, D have fallen in continued proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,单位至A名2 比例中项名C名人员在连比例中已下降。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a09f35b55fead341f55840650f2666c9cd9cebac7bc7bfac2df94bb69ed44b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since A by multiplying itself has made B, therefore A measures B according to the units in itself."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自A乘以本身以来,已经达到B,因此,根据单位本身的数字,已经达到A 整除 B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ff81128eed7125b3cb367ffb104cf73c455a814264715be66bd8481db97d9a0e","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit also measures A according to the units in it; therefore, as the unit is to A, so is A to B. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位的数据,单位的整除 A也与单位的单位和A的单位的比相同;因此,单位和A的比等于A和B的比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87591375aab3169dfaff298c712dfaaf89500ff4cfa2a45118d1960779377472","citations":["euclid-8-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But between the unit and A two mean proportional numbers have fallen; therefore two mean proportional numbers will also fall between A, B. [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但单位到A两个比例中项之间,人数已经下降;因此,2 比例中项也将下降A到B。 [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7477e27a55ec70a811c79aaf70a51cd538642d904edf9f3141c30c3cb4e9058a","citations":["euclid-8-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if two mean proportional numbers fall between two numbers, and the first be cube, the second will also be cube. [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果两个比例中项个数字在两个数字之间下降, 第一个是立方体, 第二个也将是立方体。 [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea2fbe12f79275be1d3bc58d9a51f8b935b05bb31ac1c69f77559258d365b8b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And A is cube; therefore B is also cube. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是立方体,B也是立方体Q. E.D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-3.source","contentId":"euclid-9-3","revisionId":"euclid-9-3@raw-8f00b126a004ff03","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"849b211f4113ae334aacd94e062297191cdaa8ac60dc167eb5b76f2359f80166","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.3/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.3\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-3:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-3.proof.3","euclid-9-3.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"VI